butler-docs-writing: sources and notices
========================================

The skill's layout (core rules, reference lists of phrases and structures,
before/after examples, a short self-score) follows stop-slop. The Korean
AI-tell categories in korean-ai-tells.md were gathered from the Korean
humanizer skills below and rewritten for a user manual. All wording in this
skill is our own paraphrase; no text was copied verbatim from these sources,
and nothing was taken from Wikipedia's "Signs of AI writing" (CC BY-SA).

The before/after examples come from the Butler manual itself
(packages/butler-site/src/content/docs/ko).

